PC: aching all over
HPC: ongoing for last 6/52; TATT and run down; felt last well about 4 months ago; coincided with a few weeks after return from holiday in US; had a good time and was well whilst there; no earache/cough/sob/chest pain sx; no changes in weight; less hungry; reduced appetite; no dysphagia/vomiting/blood in stool/ no issues with haematuria or dysuria; no rashes now but had a rash on back of calf noticed by wife around 3 months ago; faded by itself; had a bit of fever and sore throat at the time; did a lot of walking near Yeosemites; no blurred vision/tingling/numbness; general headache associ with current sx; been going to work; more tired at work; stress levels are fine; aching shoulders, back, hip and knees; no swelling over joints; 
PMHX: asthma (well controlled), hay fever
MEDS: asthma preventers, not needing salbutamol
SOCIAL: no smoking, occasional ETOH; lives with wife at home;

